{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0182_system_01",
      "hash": "1ff41051aba24839",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那只宝可梦正在睡觉！\\c\\n可是精灵球似乎扔不到那么远……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0182_musashi_01",
      "hash": "c76cda6867f9118e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：看来不在这一带啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0182_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "d11dc9207a414f92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：说不定再往里走走\\n就能找到了吧！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0182_musashi_02",
      "hash": "c76cd96867f90fdb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：你你你！\\n刚才偷听到我们的话了吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0182_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "d11dc8207a414ddf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：什么情况！\\n喵喵这是怎么把风的啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0182_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "b13408a97285ce1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵：喵～～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0182_musashi_03",
      "hash": "c76cd86867f90e28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：我们好不容易才查到\\n这一带有种罕见的化石，\\c\\n这么值钱的东西，才不会让\\n像你这样的家伙先找到呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0182_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "d11dc7207a414c2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：没错没错！找到化石\\n发大财的人只会是我们！我们！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0182_musashi_04",
      "hash": "c76cdf6867f91a0d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：哇哈哈哈哈哈～！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0182_max",
      "hash": "f01a51cf97fb865e"
    }
  ]
}
